-- title:
--   Ramification index one away from j=0,1728 (q=3)
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $q=3$, let $M'$ be a non-zero natural number not divisible by $q$, and let $L$ be a field of characteristic zero that is algebraic over $\mathbb{Q}$. Let $K$ be an intermediate field of $L \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ equal to [`ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L103) applied to the $\mathbb{Q}$-subfield [`ModularCurve.xHFunctionField (q ^ 2 * M') (ModularCurve.FullLevel.levelH q M')`](def/ModularCurve_XH.html#L79); that is, $K$ is the $L$-subfield of $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ generated by the coefficientwise images under [`ModularCurve.coeffEmb L`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L81) of the field generated over $\mathbb{Q}$ by ratios of integral $q$-expansions of modular forms of equal weight for $\Gamma_H(q^2M')$, where $H =$ `levelH q M'` is the kernel of the reduction $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/q)^\times$. Let $K_0$ be the corresponding $L$-subfield built in the same way from the $q$-expansion field of $\Gamma_0(M')$, and assume $K_0 \le K$. Let $j \in K$ be the element whose underlying Laurent series is the coefficientwise image of [`ModularCurve.jq`](def/ModularCurve_X0.html#L157), and let $P$ be a place of $K$ over $L$ (a proper valuation subring of $K$ containing the image of $L$ and a principal ideal ring) with $\mathrm{ord}_P(j) = 0$ and $\mathrm{ord}_P(j - 1728) = 0$. Then the ramification index of $P$ along the inclusion $K_0 \hookrightarrow K$ — the least positive $n$ of the form $\mathrm{ord}_P(f)$ for a non-zero $f \in K_0$ — equals $1$.
--
--   This is the statement that the covering $X(\Gamma_H(q^2M')) \to X_0(M')$, in its function-field incarnation over a field $L$ algebraic over $\mathbb{Q}$, is unramified at every place lying away from the cusps and away from the elliptic values $j = 0$ and $j = 1728$, here in the case $q = 3$ (the companion case being $q \ge 5$). It feeds the unramifiedness statements [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.isUnramifiedAt_of_height_one_of_algebraMap_not_mem_chartAlgInf_of_jInvChartInf_mem_xH_of_eq_three`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.isUnramifiedAt_of_height_one_of_algebraMap_not_mem_chartAlgInf_of_jInvChartInf_mem_xH_of_eq_three) and [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.isUnramifiedAt_of_height_one_of_map_jChartFin_ne_zero_of_ne_1728_xH_of_isAlgebraic_of_eq_three`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.isUnramifiedAt_of_height_one_of_map_jChartFin_ne_zero_of_ne_1728_xH_of_isAlgebraic_of_eq_three).
-- source:
